# Catch-all owner: the reader-core team (admin access on this repository). Any member
# can satisfy the required code-owner review, so normal merges stay possible — an
# author cannot approve their own pull request, and a single named owner left nobody
# able to approve the pull requests that person authored.
* @slax-lab/reader-core

# Path-level ownership lands together with the code. CODEOWNERS is LAST-MATCH-WINS,
# so keep the catch-all first and add more specific rules below as directories fill
# up (available org teams: @slax-lab/reader-core, @slax-lab/doc-maintainers).
# /apps/web/**        @slax-lab/reader-core
# /apps/extension/**  @slax-lab/reader-core
# /apps/backend/**    @slax-lab/reader-core
# /apps/cli/**        @slax-lab/reader-core
# /packages/**        @slax-lab/reader-core
# /tooling/**         @slax-lab/reader-core
# /tests/**           @slax-lab/reader-core
# /docs/**            @slax-lab/doc-maintainers
